                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.001H87/20.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Collector Cobb</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-06-26">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 26, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Advise immediately and cooperate with El Paso representative Department of
                    Justice.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
